digraph HealthQueue {
graph [rankdir=LR, bgcolor="white", splines=polyline, nodesep=0.65, ranksep=1.5, pad=0.5, outputorder=edgesfirst, forcelabels=true, fontname="Arial", fontsize=18, labelloc=t, label="HealthQueue - Clinics and schedules\nHealthQueue actual schema | 2026-11-21\nPK primary key | FK foreign key | UQ unique | ? nullable | Crow-foot notation: circle = zero, bar = one, fork = many\nSolid: identifying FK (part of child PK). Dashed: non-identifying FK. R-number matches the relationship index."];
node [shape=plain, fontname="Arial", fontsize=10];
edge [fontname="Arial", fontsize=9, color="#738697", fontcolor="#334b5d", arrowsize=0.7, penwidth=1.1];
